1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.90.12182<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 18, 2022<br/>Summer Update 2022</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20220622140334&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jungle_Moa_Nest_e3cc2f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a jungle moa nest.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Found all around <a href=\"#/wiki/Marapur\">Marapur</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Upon using the nest you will receive one of the following messages.\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>The moa parents are not happy about you touching their eggs.</b><br/></li></ul>\n<p>This message appears after using the nest &amp; will then spawn two <a href=\"#/wiki/Jungle%20Moa\">Jungle Moa</a>'s. It may take more than one attempt to spawn them. \n</p>\n<ul><li><b>You really do not want to make more Moas angry!</b></li></ul>\n<p>This message will either appear when you've recently spawned the Jungle Moa's or upon a failed spawning attempt.\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Their parents are there! You should not do this!</b><br/></li></ul>\n<p>This message appears when your characters two most recently spawned Jungle Moa's are still alive. <br/>\n</p><p>You can activate the spawn every two minutes as long as your characters most recently spawned Jungle Moa's have either been killed or moved a certain distance away from the nest. Not all Jungle Moa nest's have the ability to spawn Jungle Moa's.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Flora and Minerals</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/within-the-tides-quest\">Within the Tides Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["within-the-tides-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"within-the-tides-quest","quest":"Within the Tides Quest","step":"2-3","n":37,"title":"Encontrar a Glass Lens","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33717,"y":32777,"z":2,"label":"Jungle Moa Nest"}]}]}}